UID:hiller-284148@local-events
DESCRIPTION:11th Annual \nAirport Runway Run\n\nat San Carlos Airport\n\nR
 un • Jog • Walk\n\nTHIS EVENT HAS SOLD OUT \n\nNo delays on this tarm
 ac — rain or shine\, we’re cleared to run!\n\nExpress your need for sp
 eed with a unique 2K/5K/10K event. \nIt’s fun and healthy for the whole 
 family.\n\nDon’t miss your chance to step foot on the San Carlos Airport
  runway!\n\n2025 Hiller Aviation Museum Runway Run\n\nClick Here for 2025 
 Photos & Race Results\n\nLike an aircraft on takeoff\, you will traverse t
 he length of the entire 2\,600-foot runway of San Carlos Airport. This is 
 one of the most unique running\, walking\, and strolling experiences in th
 e Bay Area.\nThis event sells out every year\, so register now!\n\nTHIS EV
 ENT HAS \nSOLD OUT \n\nView Registration Fees\n \n\nVolunteers Get Compl
 imentary Donuts & T-shirt!\n\nView Sponsor Levels…\n\nAges: Family / kid
 s\nSource: https://www.hiller.org/event/airport-runway-run/\nLast synced: 
 2026-11-13 12:20 PST
LOCATION:Hiller Aviation Museum\, 601 Skyway Rd.\, San Carlos
URL:https://www.hiller.org/event/airport-runway-run/
END:VEVENT
